      "looked_up": true,
      "note": "I'm giving this a \"can't tell\" because I did look up the artist on MB and read the bio. I wasn't sure I had the right artist when I listened to it at first. After reading the bio, I can understand why it would appear on the journey. \"Listening-wise\" it doesn't sound very similar to sigur ros, but the description of the artist explains why users might have them on the same playlist. I think I've compromised the experiment on this one, so I chose \"can't tell\" instead of picking either option"
    },
